        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. A teacher in the District who is a member of the National Guard, or who is a commissioned reserve officer or reserved enlisted personnel in the United States military service, shall be entitled to leaves of absence from his respective duties, without loss of pay, time or efficiency rating on all days he is engaged in active duty or training ordered under the provisions of the United States military. Leaves of absence shall not exceed seventeen (17) days at any one annual period.",
            "block_bbox": [
                91,
